    "body": "## Motivation\n\nFixes #42672.\n\nNPU HiCache without FIA exposes `k_buffer` and `v_buffer` as multi-layer tensors. `MHATokenToKVPoolHost` used `getattr(..., None) or ()` before iterating them, which evaluates the tensor as a boolean and raises `RuntimeError: Boolean value of Tensor with more than one value is ambiguous` during host-pool construction.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Add a small iterator that handles missing buffers explicitly without boolean evaluation.\n- Preserve existing list/tuple behavior and let multi-layer tensors yield zero-copy per-layer views.\n- Add a CPU regression test that constructs an MHA host pool from stacked multi-layer tensor buffers.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNot applicable. This changes buffer discovery during HiCache initialization and does not change model computation or outputs.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable. The change runs only during host-pool construction.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `pre-commit run --files python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/pool_host/mha.py test/registered/unit/mem_cache/test_mem_pool_host.py`\n- `python -m py_compile python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/pool_host/mha.py test/registered/unit/mem_cache/test_mem_pool_host.py`\n- Direct CPU assertions with PyTorch 2.14 for tensor, list, missing, and `None` buffer representations\n\nThe registered test was not collected locally because the minimal macOS environment does not contain the full SGLang development dependency set. Ascend NPU end-to-end validation was not run locally and should be covered by NPU CI.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format code with pre-commit.\n- [x] Add focused regression coverage.\n- [x] Documentation update is not required for this bug fix.\n- [x] Accuracy and speed benchmarks are not applicable.\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38449365184](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38449365184)<!-- slot:p